// FA/F10=dispenser/vent/fan) while E-suffix is model-year dependent; + blink-sequence reading
// on no-readout models (count Clean/Heavy light flashes). KitchenAid/Maytag shared platform.
// F0E0 OMITTED (not valid). Drain F8 -> whirlpool-not-draining (W2). Verified vs producthelp.
// $89 residential. 4 schema entities.
